<article class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 text-center">Safe Video Downloading Practices</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-center mb-10">Published on <time datetime="<%= post.date %>"><%= post.date %></time> · Updated <time datetime="<%= post.dateModified %>"><%= post.dateModified %></time> · By <%= post.author %></p>

    <%- include('../partials/ad-unit', { adSlot: 'blog-safe-top' }) %>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Online video downloaders are convenient, but safety and legality should always come first. Follow these best practices to protect yourself and respect content creators.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">Only Download What You Own or Have Permission to Use</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">If you did not create the video and the creator has not given permission, do not download it. Most creative works are protected by copyright. Using them without permission may violate the law and the platform’s Terms of Service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">Avoid Suspicious Tools</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Stick to open, transparent services that do not require suspicious browser extensions or hidden downloads. Avoid sites that flood you with pop-ups, force extra software, or ask for unnecessary permissions.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">Use Official Sources When Possible</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Many platforms offer official download or offline features for eligible content. Use those first. Our tool is meant as a fallback for content you are legally allowed to save.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">Keep Your Device Secure</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Make sure your browser and antivirus software are up to date. Never run downloaded executable files from untrusted sources, and scan any files you are unsure about.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4">Report Abuse and Copyright Issues</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">If you see content being misused through our service, use the <a href="/dmca" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 hover:underline">DMCA / Copyright Takedown</a> page to report it. We take abuse seriously.</p>
    </div>

    <%- include('../partials/ad-unit', { adSlot: 'blog-safe-bottom' }) %>

    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <a href="/blog" class="btn-primary">Back to all guides</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

